{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Video Upscaler 是一款主打人工智能修復與放大的照片及影片工具，適合想搶救舊家庭片段、改善壓縮下載畫質，或為社交媒體素材提升清晰度的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，可一鍵將影像最高放大 4 倍至 4K 級別。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-264.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>人工智能修復與放大</h2>\n<p>此 App 內置人工智能放大引擎，可將模糊、像素化或舊有照片與影片最高放大 4 倍，並以深度學習重建細節、銳化邊緣、平衡色彩及去除數碼雜訊。它同時支援照片與影片處理，提供即時前後對比預覽，並針對 iOS 與 Apple Silicon 優化，聲稱可在裝置上快速完成修復，兼顧效率與私隱。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-277-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-278-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-279-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-280-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-281-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Video Upscaler</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/video-upscaler/id6757842205?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T06:23:53.321042+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T06:07:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T06:48:37.917542+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:24.864896+00:00","content_hash":"5e7dbb087e0e401b1b89a219351c374aeb3e1231b1bd00be5d057e29eb662dc2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}